# Reference machine classes covered by this configuration
# - x86-64 UEFI laptops/desktops (Intel/AMD/NVIDIA graphics)
# - NVMe/SATA/USB storage, ext4 root (btrfs/xfs modules)
# - Intel Wi-Fi (iwlwifi), Realtek/Intel Ethernet
# - HDA/SOF audio, PS2/USB/I2C-HID input
# - QEMU/VMware/VirtualBox VMs (virtio, simpledrm)
